  "title": "SmartUI Visual Testing Tool for Web & Mobile | TestMu AI",
  "text": "Learn how to make your agent prove it and build reliable assurance across web and mobile | Join Builders Masterclass\nPlatform \nSolutions \nResources \nCustomers\nPricing\nLogin\nBook a Demo\nGet Started Free\nSmartUI: Visual Testing Tool for Web and Mobile Apps\n\nCatch layout, CSS, and rendering bugs across browsers, real devices, Figma designs, and PDFs. Visual AI filters pixel noise, so you review only real changes.\n\nStart free with Google\nStart free with Email\n\nTRUSTED BY 3M+ USERS GLOBALLY AT\n\n+\n+\n+\n+\nOne Visual Testing Tool for Every Screen You Ship\n\nA visual testing tool compares screenshots of your UI with approved baselines. SmartUI does it for code, designs, components, and PDFs in one dashboard.\n\nStart free with Google\nVisual AI\nSmart Ignore\nRoot Cause Analysis\nNo-Code Checks\n\nSMARTUI VISUAL AI\n\nFlag Only the UI Changes Users Notice\n\nVisual AI removes anti-aliasing and font rendering noise, then labels each real change by type and severity.\n\nStart Visual Testing Free\n\nChanges Visual AI classifies\n\nLayout Shifts\nColor Changes\nMissing Elements\nNew Elements\nSize Changes\nContent Changes\n\nSMART IGNORE\n\nStop Reviewing Content That Only Moved\n\nA pixel diff marks every shifted block as changed. Smart Ignore separates moved content from new content and cuts false positives.\n\nTry Smart Ignore\nSkips ads, timestamps, and user-specific content\nHandles CMS pages that change on every publish\nAdd manual ignore regions for app-specific areas\n\nSMART RCA\n\nSee Why the UI Broke and How to Fix It\n\nSmart RCA explains what changed, why it broke, and what to fix, next to the diff.\n\nSee Smart RCA in Action\nPlain-language root cause next to every diff\nChanges ranked from critical to low severity\nSend the diff and fix to Jira or Slack in one click\n\nVISUAL TESTING WITH KANEAI\n\nWrite Visual Checks in Plain English\n\nDescribe the screen you want to check. KaneAI turns it into a visual test with the baseline and viewports set.\n\nCreate a Visual Test\nNo selectors or scripts to write or maintain\nBaselines and viewport matrix set up for you\nTests keep up with the UI through redesigns\nHow to Choose a Visual Testing Tool\nStart Visual Testing Free\n\nVisual testing tools compare screenshots in one of three ways. The method decides how much noise you review on every build.\n\nPixel Diff\n\nDOM Comparison\n\nVisual AI (SmartUI)\n\nWhat it compares\n\nEvery pixel against the baseline\n\nElement tree and positions\n\nWhat a person sees, plus DOM layout\n\nFont and anti-aliasing noise\n\nFlagged as failures\n\nNot visible to the check\n\nFiltered out\n\nDynamic content\n\nNeeds manual masks\n\nOften passes wrongly\n\nIgnored automatically\n\nContent that only moved\n\nWhole region flagged\n\nFlagged as a position change\n\nSeparated from real changes\n\nColor and image bugs\n\nCaught\n\nMissed\n\nCaught and ranked by severity\n\nReview effort per build\n\nHigh\n\nMedium\n\nLow\n\nHow SmartUI Compares to Other Visual Testing Tools\nReviewed against public docs and pricing pages, September 2026. SmartUI adds AI noise filtering, Figma comparison, and PDF testing in one tool. See the tool-by-tool comparisons.\nStart Visual Testing Free\n\nTop Choice\n\nFeatures\n\nOther Visual Testing Tools\n\nAI noise filtering\n\nSmart Ignore + Visual AI engine\nBasic threshold tuning\n\nFigma design comparison\n\nNative Figma integration\nPlugin or CLI required\n\nPDF visual testing\n\nBuilt-in PDF comparison\nAvailable in select tools\n\nMCP Server / IDE integration\n\nFull MCP Server access\nLimited framework support\n\nFramework SDKs\n\nSelenium, Cypress, Playwright, Appium\nMajor SDKs only\n\nNative mobile testing\n\nAppium, XCUITest, Espresso\nMobile SDK available\n\nCross-browser coverage\n\n3,000+ browser and OS combinations\nCloud rendering grid\n\nReal device cloud access\n\n10,000+ real devices included\nAdd-on required\n\nRoot cause analysis\n\nSmart RCA with fix suggestions\nRCA feature available\n\nBranch-aware baselines\n\nFull Git branching workflow\nBranch comparison supported\n\nPricing\n\nFree plan with 2,000 screenshots, paid by volume\nVaries by tool\nAdd Visual Tests to the Suite You Have\n\nAdd a snapshot call to an existing test, or run the CLI against Figma and Storybook. The first run sets the baseline.\n\nPlaywright\nSelenium\nCypress\nFigma\nStorybook\nGitHub Actions\n1\n// npm install @lambdatest/smartui-cli @lambdatest/playwright-driver\n\n\n2\nconst\n { chromium } = \nrequire\n(\n'playwright'\n);\n\n3\nconst\n smartuiSnapshot = \nrequire\n(\n'@lambdatest/playwright-driver'\n);\n\n4\n5\n(\nasync\n () => {\n\n6\n  \nconst\n browser = \nawait\n chromium.launch();\n\n7\n  \nconst\n page = \nawait\n browser.newPage();\n\n8\n  \nawait\n page.goto(\n'https://your-app.com/dashboard'\n);\n\n9\n10\n  \n// Capture a snapshot and compare it with the approved baseline\n\n\n11\n  \nawait\n smartuiSnapshot.smartuiSnapshot(page, \n'Dashboard'\n);\n\n12\n13\n  \nawait\n browser.close();\n\n14\n})();\n\n15\n16\n// Run: npx smartui exec node visual-test.js --config .smartui.json\n\nConfig options and full-page capture are covered in the Playwright guide. Check out our documentation\n\nCopied to Clipboard!\nVisual Regression Testing for Every Workflow\n\nDesign checks, branch baselines, and region controls keep visual tests accurate as your UI changes. Lereta has run over 1.2 million screenshots through SmartUI.\n\nFigma Visual Testing\n\nCompare Figma frames with live web and mobile screens to catch design drift before release.\n\nBranching and Merging\n\nKeep a baseline per Git branch and merge it with the code, so each feature branch is tested on its own.\n\nValidate UI Without Status Bar and Footer\n\nLeave out mobile status bars and footers, so clock and battery changes never fail a test.\n\nIgnore or Select Regions\n\nMask dynamic areas or compare only the region you care about, set per screenshot.\n\nLayout Testing\n\nDetect DOM shifts and cross-browser layout regressions before they ship to production users.\n\nPDF Testing\n\nAutomated PDF visual testing detects text, layout, font, and graphic differences.\n\nAuthor Visual Tests With The SmartUI Agent Skill\n\nPoint Claude Code, Cursor, or any AI coding agent at the open-source SmartUI Skill to add visual tests from one prompt.\n\nAgents configure baselines and viewport matrices in one prompt.\n\nWorks across Selenium, Playwright, Cypress, and Puppeteer suites.\n\nNo agent yet? Run the same checks through the SmartUI SDK.\n\nExplore SmartUI Skill on GitHub\nSmartUI + Playwright\nJS\nTS\nSmartUI + Selenium\nJava\nSmartUI + Cypress\nJS\nSmartUI + Puppeteer\nJS\nTS\n\nWorks with all agents:\n\n& more...\n\nAI-Agentic Quality Engineering\n\nRun visual tests alongside functional, mobile, and accessibility tests on 3,000+ browser and OS combinations and 10,000+ real devices.\n\nAgent Testing\nKaneAI\nBrowser Testing\nReal Device Cloud\nApp Automation\nHyperExecute\nAccessibility Testing\nAgent Testing\n\nTest AI agents such as chatbots, voice assistants and more.\n\nMore about Agent Testing\n\nAutonomous Testing\n\nDetailed analysis of the agent under test, from the perspective of a synthetic end-user.\n\nMulti-Persona Simulation\n\nDiverse user personas like International Caller, Digital Novice and more.\n\nRisk Scoring & Regression\n\nEnd-to-end regression testing for the agent under test with insights.\n\nLambdaTest is now TestMu AI\n\nOn January 12, 2026, LambdaTest evolved into TestMu AI, the same trusted testing cloud, upgraded for the AI era.\n\nNow a full-stack agentic AI quality engineering cloud, it automates end-to-end testing across web, mobile, and AI apps. The platform is AI-native, with autonomous agents that plan, author, execute, analyze, and optimize tests.\n\nVisit LambdaTest's New Home\n\nThe next era of the world's first fully Autonomous Agentic AI Quality Engineering Platform is here.\n\nAsad Khan\n\nCo-Founder & CEO\n\nLambdaTest's Next Chapter\nPLAY\nSuccess Stories of TestMu AI (Formerly LambdaTest)\n\n50%\n\nreduction in test execution time\n\n“HyperExecute is a highly reliable test execution platform and has excellent customer support.”\n\nSagar Uday Kumar\n\nSr. Engineering Manager\n\nDASHLANE\n\nLERETA\n\nDUNELM\n\nTREPP\n\nTRANSAVIA\n\nBook a Demo\nSome Love from our Customers\nAll\nTestMu AI\nKaneAI\nWeb Automation Testing\nHyperExecute\nMore\n\nAs Best Egg expanded its product offerings and entered new markets, we knew our old testing infrastructure couldn’t keep up.\nWith support from Tenny Agustin, our Engineering Operations Lead, we modernized our approach with @testmuai see more >\n\nTestMu AI\n\nBest Egg\n\nbest-egg\n\nExcited to Share My Learning Journey with Kane AI & Lambda Tool!\nI'm pleased to announce that I've recently gained hands-on experience exploring Kane AI through the Lambda Tool and it’s been a fantastic journey of upskilling!see more >\n\nKaneAI\n\nSuryateja Goud\n\nsuryateja-goud\n\nSee how @testmuai is #Futureready to enable blazing-fast test orchestration seamlessly integrated with organizations' existing CI/CD platforms, using #Microsoft Azure.\n\nTestMu AI\n\nMicrosoft India\n\nMicrosoftIndia\n\nAttended an onboarding call for KaneAI by TestMu AI.\nKaneAI is the world's first end-to-end software testing agent.see more >\n\nKaneAI\n\nAnmol Baranwal\n\nanmol-baranwal\n\nI just discovered KaneAI by TestMu AI, and it's a game-changer! Let me walk you through how it's transforming my testing workflowsee more >\n\nKaneAI\n\nMuhammad Noorani\n\nmuhammadnoorani\n\nLast Friday I was privileged to attend an onboarding call for #KaneAI with the TestMu AI team (Mayank Bhola, Sparsh Kesari, and Mudit Singh).see more >\n\nKaneAI\n\nAjika Angelo\n\najika-angelo-b240a8241\n\nI have been testing out TestMu AI's KaneAI - the first end-to-end testing assistant for days now.see more >\n\nKaneAI\n\nMbaziira Ronald\n\nmbaziira-ronald\n\nView all reviews\nMore Reasons to Love\nTestMu AI (formerly LambdaTest)\n\nSee how TestMu AI improves your testing with seamless integration, quicker results, and unmatched accuracy.\n\nStart free with Google\n\nUSERS\n\n3M+\n\nTESTS\n\n1.5B+\n\nENTERPRISES\n\n18K+\n\nCOUNTRIES\n\n132\n\nTestMu AI Named a Challenger in the 2025 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™\nRead Report\nTestMu AI recognized in The Forrester Wave™: Autonomous Testing Platforms, Q4 2025\nRead Report\nWall of Fame\n\nTestMu AI is the #1 choice for SMBs and enterprises across the globe.\n\nEnterprise-Grade Security\n\nWe safeguard your data and AI systems with global security, privacy, responsible AI, and ESG standards.\n\nIntegrations\n\nWorks where you work, 120+ integrations with the tools your team relies on.\n\n4.6\n/ 5\n\n540+ reviews\n\n4.6\n/ 5\n\n410+ reviews\n\n4.6\n/ 5\n\n540+ reviews\n\nAS SEEN ON\n\nFrequently asked questions\nWhat is a visual testing tool?\nWhat should you look for in a visual testing tool?\nHow does SmartUI work as a visual testing tool?\nWhat is the difference between visual testing and visual regression testing?\nHow does SmartUI reduce false positives?\nCan SmartUI compare Figma designs with the live product?\nCan SmartUI test PDFs?\nWhich frameworks does SmartUI support?\nDoes SmartUI work with CI/CD pipelines?\nCan AI coding agents write visual tests with SmartUI?\nIs there a free plan for SmartUI?\nIs TestMu AI recognized by industry analysts?\nTestMu AI (Formerly LambdaTest)\n/\nVisual Testing Tool\n\nTestMu AI for\nEnterprise\n\nGet access to solutions built on enterprise-grade\nsecurity, privacy, & compliance\n\nContact Sales\nBook a Demo\nAdvanced access controls\nAdvanced data retention rules\nAdvanced Local Testing\nPremium Support options\nEarly access to beta features\nPrivate Slack Channel\nUnlimited Manual Accessibility DevTools Tests\nAdvanced access controls\nAdvanced data retention rules\nAdvanced Local Testing\nPremium Support options\nEarly access to beta features\nPrivate Slack Channel\nUnlimited 